@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    This GameStore application is a demo project created for learning purposes.
    No personal data is collected, stored, or shared.
</p>

<p>
    If you add games to the store, the information is only saved locally in the database
    and is not shared with third parties.
</p>

<p>
    For a real application, this page would explain:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>What data is collected from users</li>
    <li>How the data is stored and protected</li>
    <li>Whether the data is shared with third parties</li>
    <li>How users can request deletion of their data</li>
</ul>
